Package: kubuntu-contribute
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-pyqt6, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Description: Informs users how to contribute to Kubuntu
 This application provides pointers for how to donate to Kubuntu,
 purchase hardware that supports the Kubuntu ecosystem, and get started
 contributing to Kubuntu. A generic "contribute" dialog offers all
 three options, while a more focused "donate" dialog directs the user
 to Kubuntu's donation portal.
